cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this artifact, please cite the paper below."
title: "False Positives of Prompt-Injection Detectors on Instruction-Shaped Benign Text: A Comparative Evaluation Across Seven Detectors"
abstract: >-
  Measurement artifact for a study of a layered prompt injection detector.
  Contains a 91-probe diagnostic set crossing taxonomy label with
  prompt-shapedness, the experiment scripts that drive the detector's own
  configuration interface, the raw measurement outputs, and a fail-closed
  verifier that re-derives every number reported in the paper.
type: software
